1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,740
I've just made the biggest purchase of my life.

2
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:07,219
And it's something that I've been dreaming of doing for quite some time.

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:10,460
Last week I surprised my dad with his dream property.

4
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:13,240
No! It's too much.

5
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,620
It's an abandoned barn in the middle of the Tuscan mountains,

6
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:20,219
which I'm going to attempt to turn into my dad's dream home.

7
00:00:20,339 --> 00:00:22,949
And they've given it to me as a retirement prison, absolutely flabbergasted.

8
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:27,019
But the only problem is, is that right now this isn't much of a dream.

9
00:00:28,539 --> 00:00:29,530
This is a big project.

10
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,839
And I don't know what I'm doing.

11
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:35,380
Everywhere around the barn that we looked seemed to have problems.

12
00:00:35,719 --> 00:00:37,140
Look how rotten them beams are by the way.

13
00:00:37,399 --> 00:00:38,439
That's all going to have to come out.

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,399
Oh my god, it's so wet in here.

15
00:00:41,439 --> 00:00:43,060
We've got ourselves a blinking swamp.

16
00:00:43,299 --> 00:00:45,039
All of this floor isn't floor.

17
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,200
That's not normal.

18
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,380
And these are all problems that we didn't know of before today.

19
00:00:49,579 --> 00:00:51,979
And when we dive deeper, we discover even more.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,200
Oh my god.

